---
import BaseLayout from '../layouts/BaseLayout.astro';

const lang = 'en';
---

<BaseLayout
  lang={lang}
  screen="home"
  pathOverride="/terms"
  seoTitle="Terms of Service | BayJF"
  seoDescription="Terms of Service of BayJF: the agreement covering use of this portfolio site and its content."
>
  <main class="mx-auto max-w-3xl px-6 py-20 md:py-28">
    <a href="/" class="text-sm text-sage dark:text-mint hover:underline">← Back to Home</a>
    <h1 class="mt-6 font-serif text-3xl font-bold md:text-4xl">Terms of Service</h1>
    <p class="mt-2 text-sm text-ink-soft dark:text-mist">Last updated: August 7, 2026</p>

    <div class="mt-10 space-y-10 text-sm leading-7 text-ink-soft dark:text-mist">
      <section>
        <h2 class="font-serif text-xl font-semibold text-ink dark:text-paper">1. Acceptance</h2>
        <p class="mt-2">
          Welcome to BayJF (bayjf.com), a personal portfolio website. By accessing or using the site you agree to these terms. If you do not agree, please do not use the site.
        </p>
      </section>

      <section>
        <h2 class="font-serif text-xl font-semibold text-ink dark:text-paper">2. Content</h2>
        <p class="mt-2">
          The site presents portfolio projects, experience, and skills for informational purposes. Content is provided "as is" and may change over time; no warranty of accuracy or completeness is given.
        </p>
      </section>

      <section>
        <h2 class="font-serif text-xl font-semibold text-ink dark:text-paper">3. Intellectual Property</h2>
        <p class="mt-2">
          Text, design, and media on this site belong to the site owner unless otherwise noted. Open-source projects are governed by the licenses declared in their respective repositories. You may not reuse site content for commercial purposes without permission.
        </p>
      </section>

      <section>
        <h2 class="font-serif text-xl font-semibold text-ink dark:text-paper">4. Acceptable Use</h2>
        <p class="mt-2">
          Do not use the site or its contact form in ways that harm or disrupt its operation, infringe on others' rights, or involve spam, automated abuse, or impersonation.
        </p>
      </section>

      <section>
        <h2 class="font-serif text-xl font-semibold text-ink dark:text-paper">5. Limitation of Liability</h2>
        <p class="mt-2">
          To the maximum extent permitted by law, the site owner is not liable for any indirect, incidental, or consequential damages arising from use of or inability to use this site.
        </p>
      </section>

      <section>
        <h2 class="font-serif text-xl font-semibold text-ink dark:text-paper">6. Changes & Contact</h2>
        <p class="mt-2">
          These terms may be updated; changes will be posted on this page. Questions can be sent to
          <a href="mailto:b4yernjf@gmail.com" class="text-sage dark:text-mint hover:underline">b4yernjf@gmail.com</a>.
        </p>
      </section>
    </div>
  </main>
</BaseLayout>
